00:34:33.740 --> 00:34:36.580
or at least wasn't in the
kind of low entropy state

00:34:36.580 --> 00:34:38.760
that is described by the past hypothesis?

00:34:38.760 --> 00:34:41.220
And wouldn't that in turn require

00:34:41.220 --> 00:34:43.813
already taking seriously
our records of the past?

00:34:44.880 --> 00:34:45.713
- We would, I mean,

00:34:45.713 --> 00:34:48.810
all of this is just making explicit that

00:34:48.810 --> 00:34:52.080
