theoretical knowledge rests.

00:34:52.080 --> 00:34:54.340
Any inference from present data

00:34:54.340 --> 00:34:57.680
to what it tells us
about the past in one way

00:34:57.680 --> 00:35:00.260
or another rests on the past hypothesis.

00:35:00.260 --> 00:35:02.580
So when I said if we found out,

00:35:02.580 --> 00:35:05.200
I meant if you released your commitment

00:35:05.200 --> 00:35:07.790
to the idea that there
was a past hypothesis.

00:35:07.790 --> 00:35:11.550
All of those inferences would
no longer be underwritten.

00:35:11.550 --> 00:35:13.500
It's like you have a source of informa,

00:35:13.500 --> 00:35:15.510
so this is the right way to think,

00:35:15.510 --> 00:35:19.410
or at least the way that I think of it,

00:35:19.410 --> 00:35:22.650
is making explicit the commitments,

00:35:22.650 --> 00:35:25.750
the physical commitments
on which your reliance

00:35:25.750 --> 00:35:27.073
on records rests.

00:35:29.610 --> 00:35:32.440
And all of our theoretical
knowledge of the,

00:35:32.440 --> 00:35:34.660
all of the information,

00:35:34.660 --> 00:35:37.933
not only our direct
inferences about the past,

00:35:39.870 --> 00:35:42.250
but the things that we
treat as the evidence

00:35:42.250 --> 00:35:43.380
for our theories

00:35:45.390 --> 00:35:48.840
depends on being able
to read the macro state

00:35:48.840 --> 00:35:52.323
of systems as records of their past.

00:35:56.930 --> 00:35:58.510
- Yeah, I guess, I mean,

00:35:58.510 --> 00:36:03.123
one question I would have
