00:36:22.060 --> 00:36:24.300
of inferences you're describing are

00:36:24.300 --> 00:36:28.183
to the exact details
of the past hypothesis?

00:36:29.760 --> 00:36:32.060
That's one, I mean,

00:36:32.060 --> 00:36:34.160
Is there, I mean,

00:36:34.160 --> 00:36:39.160
I take it if the universe
