00:37:18.400 --> 00:37:19.510
- Yeah, I mean,

00:37:21.480 --> 00:37:22.970
I don't know if

00:37:24.810 --> 00:37:27.080
there are alternatives actually

00:37:27.080 --> 00:37:30.230
in terms of just the frameworks

00:37:30.230 --> 00:37:32.453
that are available for calculation.

00:37:35.539 --> 00:37:36.740
I don't really know

00:37:38.700 --> 00:37:40.460
what alternatives we would have

00:37:40.460 --> 00:37:43.693
if we didn't start from
that generic assumption.

00:37:44.560 --> 00:37:47.280
- Well, I'm not challenging
